Household_services_v2 project.

to run, first create virtual environment as per requirements.txt in backend folder
run these commands in different terminals or run in background
redis-server
flask run
celery -A celery_worker.celery_app worker --loglevel=info
celery -A celery_worker.celery_app beat --loglevel=info
app is served on 127.0.0.1:5000, open on browser.